{
  "id": "GAL.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "GAL",
  "reference": "Abagalatia 1",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwania",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Paulo, ere oyio okorangerigwa koba omotomwa tikwarenge korwa ase Mwanyabaanto gose goetera ase omonto, korende goetera ase Yeso Kristo, na Nyasae Tata oyomobogetie korwa ase abakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaminto bonsi abare amo nainche aiga, twabakwanirie inwe abanto be chikanisa chia Galatia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuya bobe ase more na omorembe bikorwa ase Nyasae Tata oito, na ase Omonene Yeso Kristo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akerua ere omonyene ase engencho y’ebibe biaito, erinde atotoorie korwa ase ekegori eke ekebe kia bono, koreng’ana nogwancha kwa Nyasae Tata oito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obonene bobe ase Nyasae kare na kare. Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enchiri ende eng’ao teri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakumirie ase more inwe! Ekiagera mokomotiga iga bwango ere oyobarangeretie ase obuya bwa Kristo, na koonchokera enchiri ende eng’ao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ekeene “enchiri ende eng’ao” teiyo, korende nigo nkoyakwana aya ase engencho mbareo abanto bande bakobaotorana na korigia koonchorana enchiri ya Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende neisa koba nintwe, gose omomalaika korwa igoro, okobaranderia enchiri ende eng’ao, otatiga eria twabaranderetie, tiga omonto oyio aragererigwe goika obosiru!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buna konya twakwanire ritang’ani, bono ninkwane naende: Onye omonto okobaranderia enchiri ende eng’ao, otatiga eria mwaitaberete, oyio tiga aragererigwe goika obosiru!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono inee! Nigo eraise koigwekana gose buna inche nigo nkorigia ogwancherwa korwa ase Mwanyabaanto? Tari boigo! Keria indigetie inche nokogwenera korwa ase Nyasae! Gose, inche nigo nkorigia ogwancherwa korwa ase Mwanyabaanto? Onye nabeete nkogwenera Mwanyabaanto goika bono, anga inche tinabeete omosomba o Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buna Paulo abeete omotomwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki nimbamanyie inwe abaminto, ng’a enchiri eye nabaranderetie tiyarwete ase Mwanyabaanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki tinayenyorete korwa ase Mwanyabaanto onde, gose tinorokereretigwe na monto onde bwensi, korende ere Yeso Kristo bweka, ere omonyene akang’a inche okomaanorerwa korwa asaare ere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki mwatebetigwe amang’ana y’orogendo rwane ase amatuko aetire ase edini y’Abayahudi buna inche nachandete ekanisa ya Nyasae goetania ekerengo, na buna nateemete koyesaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inche kobua abange abarenge b’ekiare kiane ase egesaku kiane natang’anete ase edini y’Abayahudi, ngakora omokia mono ase okobwata chingencho chie chisokoro chiane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Nyasae ase obuya bwaye aganchora inche ekero konya intaraiborwa korwa ase enda ya baba na akandangeria erio imokorere. Naende ekero aetetie ayio,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agancha koorokia Omwana oye ime ase ’nde erinde, indandie Amang’ana Amaya ase egati y’abanto b’Ebisaku. Erio tinarigia konyota obosemia korwa ase Mwanyabaanto onde bwensi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gose tinatiirete kogenda Yerusalemu ase abwo barenge abatomwa b’eritang’ani ase ’nde. Korende erio kegima nkagenda Arabia, naende nkairana goika Damesiki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio magega y’emiaka etato koyaetire, ngatiira kogenda Yerusalemu gokwania Petero, nkamenya amo nere ase chichuma ibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende tinaroche motomwa onde otatiga Yakobo, momura omwabo Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio nkobariikera, nekeene. Nyasae namanyete buna tindi kongainereria!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio magega nkagenda chinsemo chia Siiria na Kilikia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase chingaki echio, inche omonyene tinamanyekanete nonde ase ababwatani be chikanisa chiare Boyahudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende barabwo nigo bamanyete okaoka aria bare koigwa korwa ase abande ng’a, “Ere oyotochandete ritang’ani, bono nkorandia are okwegena koria aare gosaria agwo ritang’ani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagatogia Nyasae ase engencho yane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "GAL.2",
    "number": "2",
    "bookId": "GAL"
  },
